@Screen list
This menu lists the screen layouts defined in a world file. These screen
layouts are used for displaying the board and status during the game, and
can also be used for text windows. A screen includes the definitions of
borders, board viewports, colours, positioning of message lines, and
status displays (normally numeric, but can also include other things).

Move the cursor to the screen that you want to edit and then push enter
to load the screen editor. Select "Add new screen" to add a new screen.

See also:
!-editscr;Screen editor
